<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Manpa adjusted Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Manpa adjusted Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales 69.44 bln bolivars vs 81.48 bln</p>
<p>Cost of sales 50.93 bln bolivars vs 63.74 bln</p>
<p>Operating costs 9.73 bln bolivars vs 9.66 bln</p>
<p>Net profit 7.69 bln bolivars vs 7.16 bln</p>
<p>Notes: Period ends September 30.</p>
<p>All results are inflation adjusted in constant Sept 30 1996 bolivars</p>
<p>Manufacturas de Papel C.A. (Manpa) is a pulp and paper manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
